Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.63,0:00:06.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're back, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.13,0:00:08.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Welcome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.46,0:00:12.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you about what\Nan absolutely perfect maid I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.71,0:00:16.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How was the entertainment district, Miss Erna?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.17,0:00:18.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Annette spent the whole time bullying me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.21,0:00:21.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want some warm milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.38,0:00:22.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.67,0:00:24.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I figured you might say that, so I made you some.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.33,0:00:25.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.33,0:00:28.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It really does feel lively,\Nnow that we're all back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:30.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's too loud in here.\NI'm gonna head to my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.33,0:00:31.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.67,0:00:34.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm not even close to done bragging yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.25,0:00:38.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you want to hear how Maid Lily\Ntook down Corpse's collaborator?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.25,0:00:41.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Y'know, technically you weren't\Nthe one who took her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.21,0:00:43.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, sure, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:48.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let her rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:52.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She pulled her weight in a big way,\Nand she's probably exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.79,0:00:56.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She was incredible, she really was.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.58,0:00:58.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.71,0:01:01.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can't even begin say how much\Nshe saved our bacon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.79,0:01:09.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure, I am a genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.08,0:01:14.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From your perspective, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.67,0:01:30.83,Song,,0,0,0,,My eyes were opened up wide
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.83,0:01:35.79,Song,,0,0,0,,By a scene that rent my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.21,0:01:38.79,Song,,0,0,0,,See it flitting, flitting through the gaps in your fingers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.79,0:01:41.42,Song,,0,0,0,,Stare at the truth as it comes into view
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.42,0:01:46.42,Song,,0,0,0,,Is what's been built here paradise?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.42,0:01:50.21,Song,,0,0,0,,Tumbling down head over heels
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.21,0:01:54.08,Song,,0,0,0,,Oh, I know this might be a wasteland
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.08,0:02:01.38,Song,,0,0,0,,But I have to land so I can survive on my own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.54,0:02:02.54,Song,,0,0,0,,I have to go now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:06.17,Song,,0,0,0,,I vomited up magificent blood
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.17,0:02:12.58,Song,,0,0,0,,That these flowers I planted here might bloom eternal
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.58,0:02:18.04,Song,,0,0,0,,I love this hopeless world enough to give
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:24.13,Song,,0,0,0,,All that my lungs and my legs and my hands have to give for it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:31.21,Song,,0,0,0,,And I swear I'll find a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:37.21,Song,,0,0,0,,That was worth all this sorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.00,0:02:47.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,As far as our preparations to infiltrate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.71,0:02:49.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the Endy Laboratory go,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:52.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the Intel squad, Operations squad,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.21,0:02:53.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and Specialist squad
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.46,0:02:55.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,are all giving it their all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.17,0:02:56.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,to carry out their challenging tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.33,0:03:00.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,However, this is our first real mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:03.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and everyone is starting to slip up\Nand show signs of psychological strain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.21,0:03:06.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Everyone, with one exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.29,0:03:12.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The success of the entire Impossible Mission\Nis resting on Monika's next operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.04,0:03:13.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and it's going to carry a fair bit of danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:17.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If necessary, I'm prepared to back her up myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.33,0:03:19.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.88,0:03:25.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I just got these bad boys in from Annette,\Nso I'll be fine all on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.25,0:03:29.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let Klaus know he can spend his time\Nhelping the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.13,0:03:32.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Monika...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.83,0:03:37.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why did they consider you\Na washout at your academy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.21,0:03:42.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If I told you it was 'cause I hit my ceiling...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.96,0:03:44.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,would you believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:47.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.88,0:03:50.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I just got bored and stopped trying, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.08,0:03:55.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.75,0:03:59.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If things look like they're going south,\NI'll give up and get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.33,0:04:03.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,C'mon, say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.21,0:04:05.75,Subtitle-2,,0,0,0,, Hurry up already.\N{\rSubtitle}C'mon, say something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:08.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've been getting a real big mouth lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.79,0:04:11.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,'Specially considering your dad's\Njust a lowly electrician.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.50,0:04:15.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,M-my dad's the best engineer in the whole Empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.25,0:04:16.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You think you can talk back to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:18.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You wanna get hit or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.33,0:04:22.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-what was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.75,0:04:24.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That hardly seems sporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.42,0:04:28.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I mean, three against one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.33,0:04:31.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,These next ones won't miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.21,0:04:33.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Guys, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.58,0:04:38.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,E-excuse me, miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.79,0:04:41.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,W-were those superpowers you just used?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.33,0:04:42.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.33,0:04:43.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then please, teach me how you did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.46,0:04:46.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to become strong like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.42,0:04:49.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That way, I can become a soldier\Nin the Imperial army someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.50,0:04:50.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.71,0:04:55.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your objective is to extract information\Nfrom an engineer named Jordan Cupca.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.38,0:05:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He does a lot of electrical work\Nfor the Endy Laboratory,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.25,0:05:03.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so he'll be well acquainted with the\Nlab's layout and inner workings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.21,0:05:06.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,His wife passed away,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.42,0:05:10.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,so he lives alone with his young son Mattel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:12.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Sure, why not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:15.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'll show you a thing or two once your school lets out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.33,0:05:17.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:40.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Just so you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.54,0:05:42.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can see you tailing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.67,0:05:44.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who hired you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.46,0:05:47.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.13,0:05:56.79,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I never made a single misstep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.13,0:06:01.04,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Was Mattel the one he was following?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.25,0:06:04.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is someone already keeping tabs on Jordan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:13.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, if whoever it is is sending out\Nshitters like this guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:15.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,then they're probably not an org worth worrying about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:23.08,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,At school, they taught me that being a soldier\Nis a good and noble job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.29,0:06:24.92,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,They said that before I was born,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.92,0:06:29.83,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,the Imperial army bravely fought back the Allies\Nand defended our nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.00,0:06:36.42,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I want to become a strong soldier so I can protect\Nthe Empire if there's ever another war.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:38.29,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,That's my dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.13,0:06:41.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What's your dream, Coach?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.33,0:06:43.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.79,0:06:45.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:46.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.00,0:06:50.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Here's a question for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.79,0:06:53.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Let's say that you had a gift for playing soccer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.50,0:06:57.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you had the skills to be the best player in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.04,0:06:58.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,would you still want to be a soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.71,0:07:03.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or what if you could be the\Nbiggest movie star in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.75,0:07:06.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You'd have more money than\Nyou knew what to do with,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.58,0:07:10.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,women fawning over you,\Nand delicious food for every meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.25,0:07:16.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you give all that up to go live in\Na cramped, musty set of barracks?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:17.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.92,0:07:19.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Or conversely,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.13,0:07:23.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,what if you entered military school and ended up\Nat the absolute bottom of your class?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.17,0:07:26.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you still want to become a soldier then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.67,0:07:31.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That does sound kind of unpleasant...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.88,0:07:33.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's all just the scraps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:38.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Us people,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:41.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we sort things into stuff that seems possible\Nand stuff that doesn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.83,0:07:47.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Then, we take the nicest thing we have left,\Ncall it a dream, and cherish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.63,0:07:52.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Is that really how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.63,0:07:55.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Say, I'm parched.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:58.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How about we stop at your place\Nand have something to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.42,0:08:07.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dang, sounds like this dad of yours is pretty great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.00,0:08:08.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.25,0:08:12.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Someday, I want to help loads of people just like him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:25.08,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I was born into a family of artists.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:28.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you were able to make it here safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.42,0:08:30.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,On our side of the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.75,0:08:34.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,there are no fires of war raging,\Njust the fires of artistic passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.75,0:08:38.71,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,During the Great War, our whole family\Nevacuated to another continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.29,0:08:42.88,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I never actually saw its ravages for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.75,0:08:45.29,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,As far as artistic sensibilities went,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.29,0:08:48.54,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,the well must have run dry after\Nmy older brother and sister were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.54,0:08:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And what about your youngest?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:54.79,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I could take up instruments\Nand get praised for my playing,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.00,0:08:58.04,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,and the paintings I drew got decent reviews, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.63,0:09:01.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Your art is technically competent,\Nbut that's all it has going for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:04.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're excellent at accurately copying things,\Nbut your work has no heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:14.33,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I decide to walk the path of the spy\Non little more than a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:18.83,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,At the time, I thought that I'd made the right decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.58,0:09:23.29,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,That I'd been born to work as a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.29,0:09:25.88,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I was so sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.29,0:09:28.75,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Right up until that fateful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.38,0:09:42.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wow! What a bunch of total weaklings!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.04,0:09:44.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I expected more out of you so-called top students.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.29,0:09:47.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You can go home now, rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.67,0:09:53.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You should be proud of the fact that they let you\Nattend this special joint training exercise
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.13,0:09:55.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,just two months after you joined your academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.63,0:09:57.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You show promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.71,0:10:00.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The way you are now, though,\Nyou aren't even close to good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.79,0:10:07.67,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,As it turned out, I was never one of the chosen ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.71,0:10:11.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Remember this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.04,0:10:13.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In our world, people without fire in their hearts...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.83,0:10:16.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,are nothing more than garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.54,0:10:28.00,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,That was the day I started half-assing my training.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.08,0:10:33.46,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.46,0:10:35.38,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,The drugs will wear off soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.42,0:10:53.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.79,0:11:06.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.63,0:11:08.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Hands up, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.04,0:11:13.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I took a look at your false-bottomed drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:16.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's quite the document you compiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.29,0:11:18.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.88,0:11:20.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.63,0:11:22.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.88,0:11:26.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You want to defect, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.46,0:11:29.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can help with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've given up on the Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.33,0:11:42.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That lab's been conducting human experiments\Non death row convicts,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.71,0:11:44.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,and they're still going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.13,0:11:53.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I decided to steal their secret data little by little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:58.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That way, I could leak it to another country someday\Nand expose the Empire's misdeeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.21,0:12:02.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you're investigating the lab,\Nthen this is the best thing I could have asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.63,0:12:03.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I would be more than happy to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.96,0:12:05.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,There's too much here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.29,0:12:12.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Didn't anyone get suspicious\Nwhile you were snatching up all this intel?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.71,0:12:17.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mattel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.08,0:12:21.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you, Jordan Cupca.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.13,0:12:25.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We're here on behalf of Imperial counterintelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.25,0:12:29.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest for suspected espionage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.04,0:12:30.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Th-there must be some sort of misunderstanding here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.83,0:12:34.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm just a lowly electrician, and I've always\Nbeen completely faithful to the-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.46,0:12:37.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.21,0:12:42.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Quit playing dumb, or you and the kid both get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:45.08,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Jordan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.08,0:12:47.83,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,You were sloppy, and now, you're paying the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:51.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I swear,  I have no idea what you're talking about...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.42,0:12:56.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You know, I got the oddest report this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.42,0:12:59.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Apparently, someone took out one of my agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.63,0:13:03.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You haven't made contact with\Na foreign spy, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.83,0:13:06.13,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I've already completed my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.13,0:13:08.25,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,There's no need to put myself in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.46,0:13:09.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.17,0:13:12.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:14.71,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Abandon the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.71,0:13:17.21,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,As a spy, that's the correct call to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.67,0:13:20.21,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.67,0:13:23.46,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Just like I always have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.50,0:13:27.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look out, Teach, I've got a hostage!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.08,0:13:30.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If you come one step closer,\Nthis report you wrote is going up in smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.67,0:13:32.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And she's got me as her bodyguard, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.29,0:13:36.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How do ya like them apples?\NNow you've got no choice but to surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.83,0:13:39.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.33,0:13:49.88,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I should just give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.21,0:13:54.54,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I'll never be like that examiner or like Teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.42,0:13:59.25,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,No how much I work,\Neven if I spend my entire life trying,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:02.13,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I'll never be able to surpass them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.08,0:14:08.88,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I'll just be a half-baked, slightly above-average spy\Nwho gets used up and thrown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.88,0:14:10.63,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,That's my lot in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.92,0:14:14.38,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,What the hell is there to passionate about in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:16.79,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:18.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Leave my dad alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.08,0:14:21.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You little shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.13,0:14:24.33,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.33,0:14:26.33,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Why am I still standing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.46,0:14:29.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next time, we'll take Teach down for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.38,0:14:32.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,All these defeats have just been\Npaving the way to our victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.38,0:14:35.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yeah! We can't keep losin' forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.50,0:14:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,In that case, I have a plan I would like to try out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:41.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to be part of the attack team next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.75,0:14:45.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I-if it's all right, I have an idea I'd like to share!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.79,0:14:47.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to play with Klaus too, yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.08,0:14:51.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Next time, my honey trap will take him down for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:14:59.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Well, this feels like shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.42,0:15:00.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:02.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:03.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Fight back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:10.04,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Are they starting to rub off on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.92,0:15:12.13,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,That's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:19.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:24.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you care what happens to\Nyour adorable little son?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.50,0:15:26.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Out with it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.17,0:15:28.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.96,0:15:42.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Plunging the room into darkness was a bad move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:46.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can sense everything that happens in here\Nthrough my fingertips.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.92,0:15:49.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,And you couldn't have warned me about that first?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.83,0:15:51.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Coach?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.46,0:15:54.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't play with your food.\NEnd it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.42,0:15:57.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I know, I know.\NYou're no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:06.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.50,0:16:09.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What a shame.\NYou weren't up to par.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.58,0:16:12.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That technique hardly seems fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.54,0:16:15.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Feeling confident enough to make small talk, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.42,0:16:17.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.38,0:16:21.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's so handy, I'm gonna have to use it against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.58,0:16:28.29,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,I can feel it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.79,0:16:32.33,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,My captured arm is telling me the\Nposition of every single wire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.33,0:16:36.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.00,0:16:46.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Damn you, child!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.96,0:16:48.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She's just throwing them blind!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.88,0:16:50.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,She won't keep getting lucky shots in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:52.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.25,0:17:00.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Why aren't they getting caught by my wire net?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:02.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It's just math.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.33,0:17:03.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.67,0:17:05.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I've got a knack for calculations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.25,0:17:07.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Now that I know where your wires are,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.21,0:17:10.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,all I have to do is make sure\Nmy rebounds weave between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.88,0:17:13.67,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!\NNobody could do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.04,0:17:15.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Couldn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.54,0:17:17.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm code name Glint,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.88,0:17:20.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,now, let's harbor love for as long as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.88,0:17:22.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Kill the hostages!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.04,0:17:43.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.96,0:17:46.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I could ask you the same thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.29,0:17:52.63,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Back when you beat Lily and Sybilla,\Nyou probably did it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.63,0:17:54.50,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,by having them catch each other in friendly fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.50,0:17:56.79,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Klaus?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.08,0:18:05.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:08.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Mattel...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.04,0:18:10.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Looks like neither of you got hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.58,0:18:12.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Wh-who in the world are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.33,0:18:16.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Like I told you, someone who's on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.25,0:18:23.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Go to this address and give them this password.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.50,0:18:26.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,They'll give you asylum in the Republic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.79,0:18:29.46,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,From the bottom of my heart, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.46,0:18:30.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You've done so much for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.42,0:18:34.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're all right, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.92,0:18:36.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.17,0:18:41.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,When you said you didn't have superpowers,\Nyou never told me you knew magic, Coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.58,0:18:43.92,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That wasn't magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.38,0:18:47.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I can run calculations a bit faster\Nthan most people, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.33,0:18:55.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Creepshot...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.54,0:18:57.58,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That's the only ability I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:18:59.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Pretty underwhelming, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.75,0:19:03.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You're the best spy in the whole world, Coach!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.38,0:19:07.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I want to become strong like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.38,0:19:25.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,You really are in league of your own, Monika.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.42,0:19:28.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The boss was right
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.38,0:19:32.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,when he said it was a stroke of good luck\Nfinding you amongst the academy washouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:36.71,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,He described your talents as\N"frighteningly magnificently."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.75,0:19:39.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.13,0:19:41.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Who knew our Klaus was such a flatterer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.00,0:19:45.21,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Would you mind if I asked you another question?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.58,0:19:52.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Two days ago, you told me that you stopped trying\Nbecause you hit your ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:56.08,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That was why you washed out at your academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.54,0:19:58.75,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah? Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.29,0:20:04.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,If that's the case, why do you choose\Nto stay in Lamplight?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.67,0:20:15.17,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't have any big fancy reason,\Nbut if I had to pick one...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.50,0:20:16.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.38,0:20:20.50,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I guess it'd be the friendly faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:26.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I think that's a wonderful answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.08,0:20:42.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.00,0:20:48.79,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I was so sure that now that we'd\Ncompleted our big missions,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.79,0:20:52.13,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,we would be strong enough to overpower Teach...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.13,0:20:55.63,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,We fucked up and used way too much gunpowder.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.63,0:20:57.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,How unlucky...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.67,0:21:00.83,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,This team would be in a sorry state without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.83,0:21:02.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A sorry state indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.17,0:21:06.88,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Look, I've got a plan that might be worth trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:10.38,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I'm in!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.08,0:21:19.25,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Another year, another test that nobody passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.75,0:21:22.33,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Same deal with the boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.33,0:21:24.54,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That makes, what, ten years running?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.54,0:21:28.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,I don't know why we even keep doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.71,0:21:33.04,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,Running this Inferno recruitment exam\Ndisguised as a special training exercise, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.29,0:21:34.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,The way I see it,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.29,0:21:38.96,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,the problem is how we set the passing condition\Nas having skills on par with Klaus's or better.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.42,0:21:45.29,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,That girl showed promise, but she wasn't up to snuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.50,0:21:49.42,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how exceptional\Nsomeone's talents are,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.42,0:21:53.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,they'll never make the grade\Nwith a heart as frozen over as hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.17,0:21:56.38,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.17,0:22:00.38,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,But the thing about people is, they change.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.79,0:22:04.29,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,And that transformation...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.08,0:22:06.38,Subtitle-3,,0,0,0,,can be magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.29,0:02:49.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(268.8,612)}{\an7}2 Months Ago ~ Darton, Galgad Empire Capital
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.71,0:02:56.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(115.2,612)}{\an7}FILE: Glint
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.46,0:11:34.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(166.4,144)}{\an7}FILE: Glint
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.50,0:20:31.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,576)}{\an7}The Present
